  "CharacterDescription": "Daryn Hornwood is the heir to the Hornwood, son of Lord Halys Hornwood and Lady Donella Manderly. He is in his late teens, a young man growing into the responsibilities of a Northern lordship that sits between the Dreadfort and the coastal routes north of Winterfell. The Hornwood is not large but its position is strategically significant - the Boltons have long had designs on it. He has ridden south with Robb Stark as the Hornwood tradition of Stark loyalty demands. He is young and not yet certain of himself in the way that the war will either forge or break.",
